## API

### `formatRelative(date, options?)`

Returns a localized string describing `date` relative to the current time.

```ts
function formatRelative(
  date: Date | number | string,
  options?: FormatRelativeOptions
): string;

interface FormatRelativeOptions {
  now?: Date | number | string;
  locale?: string | string[];
}
```

| Option | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `now` | `Date.now()` | Reference time. Useful for tests and server-rendered output. |
| `locale` | `"en"` | Locale passed to `Intl.RelativeTimeFormat`. |

