- Future dates use phrases such as `"in 3 days"`.
- Automatic phrasing is enabled, so some locales produce `"yesterday"` instead of `"1 day ago"`.

```js
formatRelative(date, { locale: "fr" });
// "il y a 5 minutes"
```

